Package: sx1302-hal
Version: 2.1.2-1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Michales Michaloudes <korgie@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 911
Pre-Depends: debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), systemd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Lora-net/sx1302_hal
Description: Semtech SX1302/SX1303 LoRa concentrator HAL and packet forwarder
 Hardware Abstraction Layer, packet forwarder, and utility programs
 for LoRa gateways based on the Semtech SX1302/SX1303 concentrator chip.
 .
 Includes lora_pkt_fwd (packet forwarder), util_chip_id, util_net_downlink,
 util_spectral_scan, util_boot, reset_lgw.sh, and reference configuration
 files for Bobcat 300 gateways.
 .
 The packet forwarder is configured for Semtech UDP protocol (data-only);
 no Helium blockchain/miner stack is required.
